WEBVTT

00:00:57.595 --> 00:01:02.565
you’ve been granted use of all 45 units 
in your current location.

00:01:02.565 --> 00:01:05.301
With some strategic fuel caching 
along the way,

00:01:05.301 --> 00:01:08.969
you might be able to 
make it all 23 parsecs.

00:01:08.969 --> 00:01:12.349
So how can you reach the 
alien space station?

00:01:15.501 --> 00:01:17.261
Answer in 3,

00:01:17.261 --> 00:01:18.777
2,

00:01:18.777 --> 00:01:20.445
1.

00:01:20.445 --> 00:01:25.305
It’s possible to solve this riddle using 
as few as two cache points,

00:01:25.305 --> 00:01:28.572
and there are also valid solutions 
that use more.

00:01:28.572 --> 00:01:30.503
No matter how you go about it though,